notes.content:
- reduced number of triangles and increased their size in drop-down-triangles-level;
- marked every 5 level in menu;
- less noticeable circle increase on hovering at cursor-chaos-level;
- at the level where the eye closes, white figures now take out other figures;
- improved rotating triangles-squares-rectangles level;
- made white balls more noticeable at the level where white and black balls fall;
- at the level where triangles come in from the left, now you can change the color by holding down left mouse button;
- small music change

- made cursor-chaos-level clearer (I hope so);
- fixed restart in labyrinth-level when reaching the end;
- made contractive triangle in assembling-triangle-level;
- increased spawn time on shoot-falling-balls-level from 6 to 7 sec interval;
- small visual fixes for menu icons
